      </section>

      <section id="english" class="english" lang="en">
        <h2>Summary in English</h2>
        <p>
          This is a summary of the privacy notice above, which is given under Turkey's Personal Data Protection Law
          No. 6698 (KVKK). The Turkish text is the authoritative version.
        </p>
        <ul class="plain">
          <li>
            <strong>Controller:</strong> Akın Özgen, a private individual, reachable at
            <a href="mailto:akinozgen@protonmail.com">akinozgen@protonmail.com</a>.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Without an account</strong> the site's database keeps nothing about you. Games keep settings, progress
            and statistics in your browser's localStorage. Daily puzzles send each guess to the server to be judged;
            the guesses of players who are not signed in are not stored. Every request passes through Cloudflare,
            which processes your IP address; the site's server logs are kept for 3 days. The site's own pages (not
            the games) load a font from Google Fonts, which gives Google your IP address.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>An account is optional</strong>, needed only to keep your records across devices and to play
            harfiyen online. Sign-in is handled by Google Firebase Authentication (USA); your password never reaches
            this site's server. The server stores your email address, sign-in method, Firebase user id, a random
            account id, your display name, account dates, a hash of your session id, your puzzle moves and results, a
            one-time copy of your device's statistics, and your harfiyen rooms and results.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>harfiyen online rooms</strong> hold the game, both players' display names, the last 50 chat
            lines (filtered) and, only if you turn notifications on, your browser's push subscription. An unanswered
            invitation is deleted after 7 days; a game left idle for 30 days is closed and deleted 7 days later; the
            room of a finished game is deleted 7 to 30 days after its last activity.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>One cookie</strong>, <code>__Host-oturum</code>, strictly necessary for the session. No
            analytics, ads, tracking, profiling or sale of data.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Data is processed outside Turkey</strong> (Cloudflare, Google, browser push services, Proton). The
            Turkish authority has issued no adequacy decision for these countries, and no KVKK standard contract has
            been signed with these providers.
          </li>
          <li>
